,"args":["&张飞\n兒子，這次你就跟趙雲一起去救人吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[54,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张苞\n是。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n真是個有為的年輕人，\n張將軍好福氣！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[54,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张苞\n哪裡！您太客氣了。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,3,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n哈哈！這話俺愛聽！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[54,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[34,0,2]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset":8224,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8249,"body_end":8720,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[66]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,2]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n這此我不會逃跑了，\n我要賭上性命戰鬥，\n與哥哥們、妹妹共存亡！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n少將軍固然英勇，\n但是您還不是龐德的對手。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n我曾與他切磋過，他與我不相上下。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[33,0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[3,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张飞\n喔？原來趙雲你還和他打過？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n是啊，當時的情況是……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许子将\n…………"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[34,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&赵云\n罷了，總之他是個很厲害的傢伙。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关羽\n是嗎？那麼關某也想會會那龐德呢。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[3,0]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":8,"offset":8720,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":8745,"body_end":9400,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"com